WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.820 --> 00:00:01.820
Speaker 1: All right.

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:04.960
Let me talk about something that that happened
over the weekend.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:15.589
As many of you know, when the latest Israeli-Palestinian
flare up took place at first for the first

00:00:15.589 --> 00:00:21.100
four or so days, I. I didn't say anything
about it, feeling I didn't really have too

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.420
much to add.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:27.279
I heard from some people, respectively, who
said, hey, you should talk about this.

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:28.279
And then so I did.

00:00:28.279 --> 00:00:30.360
And I did a 20 minute segment over the last
month.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.259
It's the only twenty minute segment I've done.

00:00:32.259 --> 00:00:38.960
And that was a couple of weeks ago and throughout
before I talked about it and after the anti-Semitic

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:44.950
comments raining down on our YouTube channel,
raining down on Twitter, Instagram, we had

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:50.310
to block Twitch thousands close to a thousand
people.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.090
I would say I don't want to exaggerate.

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:58.720
Certainly hundreds of people on YouTube, about
a hundred on on Twitter.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:03.130
Call it six hundred to eight hundred people,
probably OK to not not be hyperbolic, which

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.860
is, you know, a lot for our program, our size.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:11.700
And even after I did the segment, the anti-Semitic
comments about me being a Jew rat or all of

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.990
the different stuff, they just didn't stop.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:17.450
And at a certain point, it sort of becomes
clear that you're not really contacting me

00:01:17.450 --> 00:01:19.880
about foreign policy anymore.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:21.090
It's just the anti-Semitism.

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:22.700
That's really what it is.

00:01:22.700 --> 00:01:24.920
This crossed over to the real world.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:32.950
And over the weekend, I was out with some
friends for dinner at at a restaurant.

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:38.229
And we were there sort of a lot of things
are still closing early in the Northeast because

00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:39.450
of covid guidelines.

00:01:39.450 --> 00:01:42.450
And so there were very few people left.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:47.700
And as I was leaving, I walked by someone
who kind of gave me a weird look.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:52.500
And I didn't know if it was that, you know,
I had some borscht on my face like that one

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.790
time where I did an entire show with with
borscht on my face.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.810
And producer Pat didn't tell me or maybe they
recognized me.

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:01.200
I didn't really know walk past them.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:12.160
And when I'm 30 feet away, I hear Pakman and
I turn around and they yell at me, you Jew,

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.660
Zionist, imperialist.

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:20.330
Now, I just turned and walked away, I didn't
engage with it, and I think in general what

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:27.180
these people want is a reaction and who knows
if they plan to film me and put it on Twitter

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.670
or whatever the case.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.410
But I just I just walked away.

00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:40.000
And, you know, this what's really obviously
this is not fun, but people come up to me

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:43.300
all the time and typically they're their positive
experiences.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.130
And I do a show that's public.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:48.840
And so to some degree, this is this is bound
to happen.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:53.590
But, you know, this is this was a, quote,
left winger, right.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:54.750
This is not a right winger.

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.470
This is an issue that it's more often the
left.

00:02:57.470 --> 00:03:01.970
The right does a lot of anti Semitism with
me, but they say go back to Israel.

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:02.970
Right.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.550
The right wing anti-Semitism is go back to
Israel, a place I've been once in my life

00:03:06.550 --> 00:03:09.200
for nine days.

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:11.710
This is this was something from the left.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:17.040
And so I think it should be clear to all of
us at this point that this is not a critique

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.100
of my position.

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:19.100
Right.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:21.030
It's not it's not even really an argument.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:27.430
As many of you know, I have more than a decade
on record of being unquestionably critical

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:33.090
of settlements, the Netanyahu administration,
the urgency with which we need to find a way

00:03:33.090 --> 00:03:34.730
to lift the blockade.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:38.170
I'm not going to do the segment and to see
this is the problem.

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:40.080
Why am I even talking about policy?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:42.840
Because this incident was not about policy.

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:49.390
I've spoken about, you know, the Israeli-Palestinian
conflict really once in the last two years.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:57.480
And so Jew, Zionist imperialist is not even
plausibly a critique of my policy.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.540
And all sorts of things are going off here.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:02.030
So what do we do about something like this?

00:04:02.030 --> 00:04:03.030
I don't know.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:05.460
I don't really plan to do anything about it.

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.210
There's a there's a real problem with anti-Semitism
on the right.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.630
And we've covered it for a really long time.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:16.790
We just reviewed on a recent live stream that
white nationalist dude who wanted Craig Cobb,

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:23.650
who wanted a whites only enclave in one of
the Dakotas, and he was overtly anti-Semitic

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:24.650
during our interview.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.660
And that's very clearly a right wing anti-Semitism.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:31.620
Unfortunately, there's a left wing anti-Semitism
as well.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:36.290
And even by talking about this, there's going
to be even more that's hurled at me.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.521
And some people are going to write and say,
well, it's not anti-Semitism, David, because

00:04:40.521 --> 00:04:42.080
you are a Zionist.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.150
And as I've always said before, what do you
even mean by that term?

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:52.210
Every time I've been confronted with it, I
never really get a straight answer.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:58.780
And what I've said before is if what you're
asking me is, do I think that the solution

00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:02.200
to the Israeli-Palestinian conflict is no
more Israel?

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:05.270
No, I don't think that's the solution.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.240
Much like the solution is not.

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.990
No, no Palestinian state.

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:09.990
Right.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:13.290
I think the solution is an Israeli state and
a Palestinian state.

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:16.190
Does it does that make me a Zionist?

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:19.170
Because otherwise it's never anything we're
we're able to actually figure out.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:27.080
But hurling Jew, Zionist imperialist to someone
on the street is is over the line.

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:29.060
It's not a policy critique.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:37.690
I don't know what else to say about it, but
if the left goes too far in this direction,

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:39.540
it's not going to be good.

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:42.470
And as I said before, it's counterproductive.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:49.020
It's counterproductive because every time
Jewish folks hear about not what happened

00:05:49.020 --> 00:05:52.780
to me, what happened to me was not violent,
wasn't physically violent, but what we believe

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:58.900
the videos we saw from Los Angeles, New York,
etc., more and more American Jews or Jews,

00:05:58.900 --> 00:06:05.370
wherever they're being harassed in France,
say, wow, I really may need to move to Israel

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.370
someday.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:12.620
And they disengage from holding Israel accountable
for the things Israel does wrong.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:17.750
So not only do I think it's ugly and disgusting,
it's also counterproductive to what most of

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.970
these leftists claim to want.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:24.200
I think that's all I really feel the need
to say about it.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:27.889
Maybe something I'll follow up on at some
point in the future, but really ugly stuff

00:06:27.889 --> 00:06:28.889
unbecoming.

00:06:28.889 --> 00:06:29.060
Unbecoming of the left

